WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.555
Build confidence through three complete
kitchens, with your rep alongside you for

00:00:02.555 --> 00:00:05.110
coaching and review.

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:09.850
Keep the original order, related purchase
orders and any replacements together under

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:14.040
one kitchen project. That makes the full
job easier to follow.

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:18.207
Your team prepares the forms and submits
the orders, including the first three

00:00:18.207 --> 00:00:21.823
kitchens. Your rep coaches and reviews with
you through quoting, ordering,

00:00:21.823 --> 00:00:25.440
acknowledgment, delivery and installation.

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:29.317
Once installation is complete, check that
any parts or service work needed to finish

00:00:29.317 --> 00:00:32.643
the kitchen has been resolved. Keep the
final updates with the job so everyone
knows

00:00:32.643 --> 00:00:35.970
where things stand.

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:40.537
After three separate, complete kitchens,
talk with your rep about what feels

00:00:40.537 --> 00:00:44.553
comfortable and where more practice would
help. Your rep confirms when you're ready

00:00:44.553 --> 00:00:48.570
to order independently, or helps you plan
the next training step.
